==Description==
The '''Null Dimension Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 26 of the premium [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{GumDrops|690}} or {{Robux|56}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|8,240}} or {{Robux|1,713}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|70}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Robux|2,154}}.

The '''Null Dimension Nametag''' has purple gradient text with a black outline. Black and purple smoke falls down behind the text and multiple small purple triangles appear on it.

